B.aaN=new A.hW("Wallets and transactions","Wallet balances and transaction records are subject to the app status and the relevant payment or banking partner. A transaction is not complete merely because a request was submitted. The final terms must define processing, reversal, settlement and dispute timelines.",null)
B.aaI=new A.hW("Fees and limits","Any applicable fees, exchange rates and transaction limits must be displayed before the user confirms a transaction. The final terms must explain when fees are charged and whether they can be refunded.",null)
B.aaK=new A.hW("Acceptable use and service availability","Users must not use OminiPay for unlawful activity, fraud, sanctions evasion or unauthorised access. Features may be limited for security, compliance, maintenance or partner availability reasons, subject to applicable law.",null)
B.aaJ=new A.hW("Complaints, liability and governing law","The operator must insert its verified complaints process, service commitments, liability terms, dispute resolution process and governing-law wording. Nigerian law is a proposed starting point, not a final legal determination.",null)
